      "description": "Lock in around the clock with a host of exciting features designed to level-up your NBA 2K27 experience anytime and anywhere. Create unique builds with the built-in MyPLAYER builder, rally your friends with Crew management and social features, and claim rewards every day. Play beyond the whistle with NBA 2K HQ and stay connected to NBA 2K27.\n\nMyPLAYER BUILDER\n\nShape your game wherever you go. Access the full NBA 2K27 MyPLAYER Builder directly in-app and upload builds you create on NBA 2K HQ right onto your home console setup. Then, share them from anywhere via QR codes.\n\nSOCIAL AND CREW INTEGRATION\n\nTap into your squad 24/7 with full Crew management and NBA 2K’s social features. With both real-time messaging and roster management, NBA 2K HQ puts the NBA 2K social experience in the palm of your hand.   \n\nDAILY REWARDS\n\nStart your day with a fresh drop! NBA 2K HQ features mobile-exclusive daily login rewards!\n\nPROGRESSION TRACKING\n\nStay in the moment by viewing your progress and rank in real-time. NBA 2K HQ features continuous tracking for Daily Leaderboards and Crew Rewards so you can focus on your climb to the top.\n\nFACE SCAN\n\nThe new-and-improved Face Scan features a quicker, more accurate scanning process with high-fidelity texture quality–all designed to place you right into your very own basketball fantasy. Your game. Your look.\n\nRequires internet connection and iOS 18 or above\n\nDo Not Sell or Share My Personal Information: https://www.take2games.com/ccpa\n\nUse of this application is governed by the Terms of Service (ToS) found at www.take2games.com/legal. Online and certain special features require an internet connection, may not be available to all users or at all times, and may be terminated, modified, or offered under different terms without notice. For more information on the availability of online features and services visit https://bit.ly/2K-Online-Services-Status.",
