      "releaseNotes": "Level-Up Your NBA 2K Experience with NBA 2K HQ\nLock in around the clock with features designed to take your NBA 2K27 game anytime and anywhere. Play beyond the whistle and stay fully connected to the court, your squad, and your rewards.\n\nMyPLAYER Builder\nShape your game wherever you go. Access the full NBA 2K27 MyPLAYER Builder directly in-app and upload your custom builds straight to your home console setup. Easily share your favorite creations from anywhere using QR codes.\n\nSocial & Crew Integration\nTap into your squad 24/7. With real-time messaging, complete roster management, and NBA 2K’s social features, NBA 2K HQ puts the community experience in the palm of your hand.\n\nDaily Mobile Rewards\nStart every day with a fresh drop. Claim mobile-exclusive daily login rewards!\n\nProgression Tracking\nStay in the moment by viewing your progress and rank in real-time. Continuous tracking for Daily Leaderboards and Crew Rewards keeps you locked in on your climb to the top.\n\nFace Scan\nStep onto the floor as yourself. Our upgraded Face Scan delivers a faster, more accurate scan with high-fidelity texture quality to put you directly into the action.",
